<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT SRI LANKA'S PRESIDENTS XI BY TWO WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT SRI LANKA'S PRESIDENTS XI BY TWO WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat Sri Lanka's Board</p>
<p>President's XI by two wickets in a one-day match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka Board President's XI 240-7 innings closed,</p>
<p>India 243-8 (R.Dravid 95).</p>
</text>
